*20
	08-D2AA-D
	 
	FAMILY-OF-8 TELETYPE TESTS
	THROUGH PT08 LT08 OR DC02
	INTERFACE
	 
	ST ADD
	LSW = 200  ST LSW
	 
	ALSO
	SET LOC 0020 TO
	1  0000 FOR KSR OR ASR 33 TTY
	2  0001 FOR KSR OR ASR 35 TTY
	3  0002 FOT KSR 37 TTY
	SET LOC 0021 TO
	BITS 0-5 = DEVICE CODE OF KEYBOARD OR READER TO BE TESTED
	BITS 6-11 = DEVICE CODE OF THE PRINTER OR PUNCH TO BE TESTED
	 
	SW SET
	REFER TO PROGRAM DESCRIPTION TO DET SUB PROG AND SW SET
